b2" :question/problem "The arrows show $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf a$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf b$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf c$. Grid squares have side length one unit.\n\n![](images/c1/c17a5d06bf0ff0b67565880092c6dbdcd085d1460b610f35634f649c88b77998.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$."] [:db/add "a27601af-a5b2-5b2c-bf35-e7d92d0686b2" :question/worked-solution "Construct the known component $\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}$ from $O$, and call its endpoint $P$. Count signed horizontal and vertical grid displacements:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OP} &=\\frac{4}{3}\\,(3, 0)=(4, 0). \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{PC} &=(4, -4).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](images/e6/e6f785f03744709ff1340cc3f6fdad62001df775a1f2972fbd6796844c358875.png)\n\nCompare the remaining displacement with $\\mathbf{a}$, whose grid displacement is $(4, -4)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Horizontal scale} &=\\frac{4}{4}=1 \\\\\n\\text{Vertical scale} &=\\frac{-4}{-4}=1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe scale is positive, so the remaining vector has the same direction as $\\mathbf{a}$. Thus $\\overrightarrow{PC}=\\mathbf{a}$. By the triangle law,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c} &=\\overrightarrow{OP}+\\overrightarrow{PC} \\\\\n&=\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}+\\mathbf{a} \\\\\n&=\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, so their coefficients are unique. Matching the coefficient of $\\mathbf{a}$ gives $\\lambda=1$."] [:db/add "a27601af-a5b2-5b2c-bf35-e7d92d0686b2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a27601af-a5b2-5b2c-bf35-e7d92d0686b2" :question/answer-fields "f6189845-6d98-50aa-bfae-2c5db76fdd51"] [:db/ensure "a27601af-a5b2-5b2c-bf35-e7d92d0686b2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096701 :knowledge-point/questions "a27601af-a5b2-5b2c-bf35-e7d92d0686b2"] [:db/add "de35b725-4799-5582-9ab1-33199e0c880a" :answer/id #uuid "de35b725-4799-5582-9ab1-33199e0c880a"] [:db/add "de35b725-4799-5582-9ab1-33199e0c880a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "de35b725-4799-5582-9ab1-33199e0c880a" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "de35b725-4799-5582-9ab1-33199e0c880a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "55014503-8a9d-56a5-8190-ad2540b3f96a" :answer/id #uuid "55014503-8a9d-56a5-8190-ad2540b3f96a"] [:db/add "55014503-8a9d-56a5-8190-ad2540b3f96a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "55014503-8a9d-56a5-8190-ad2540b3f96a" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "55014503-8a9d-56a5-8190-ad2540b3f96a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cd716e7e-dbf8-535c-a0c9-9394e3519c2e" :answer/id #uuid "cd716e7e-dbf8-535c-a0c9-9394e3519c2e"] [:db/add "cd716e7e-dbf8-535c-a0c9-9394e3519c2e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cd716e7e-dbf8-535c-a0c9-9394e3519c2e" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}"] [:db/ensure "cd716e7e-dbf8-535c-a0c9-9394e3519c2e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0f733542-f253-5775-a026-3542357bd2df" :answer/id #uuid "0f733542-f253-5775-a026-3542357bd2df"] [:db/add "0f733542-f253-5775-a026-3542357bd2df" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0f733542-f253-5775-a026-3542357bd2df" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "0f733542-f253-5775-a026-3542357bd2df" :answer/validate] [:db/add "093e41fc-a215-5606-a67a-9c58c29aad53" :answer/id #uuid "093e41fc-a215-5606-a67a-9c58c29aad53"] [:db/add "093e41fc-a215-5606-a67a-9c58c29aad53" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "093e41fc-a215-5606-a67a-9c58c29aad53" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "093e41fc-a215-5606-a67a-9c58c29aad53" :answer/validate] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/id #uuid "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1"] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/choices "de35b725-4799-5582-9ab1-33199e0c880a"] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/choices "55014503-8a9d-56a5-8190-ad2540b3f96a"] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/choices "cd716e7e-dbf8-535c-a0c9-9394e3519c2e"] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/choices "0f733542-f253-5775-a026-3542357bd2df"] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/choices "093e41fc-a215-5606-a67a-9c58c29aad53"] [:db/add "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/correct "cd716e7e-dbf8-535c-a0c9-9394e3519c2e"] [:db/ensure "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11" :question/id #uuid "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11"] [:db/add "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11" :question/problem "The arrows show $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf a$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf b$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf c$. Grid squares have side length one unit.\n\n![](images/5f/5f32d62f2c3f23418be558580cc601f78c8a14154a77f805d58da57fcf0e49e7.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$."] [:db/add "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11" :question/worked-solution "Construct the known component $\\mathbf{b}$ from $O$, ending at $B$. Count signed horizontal and vertical grid displacements:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OB} &=1\\,(0, -3)=(0, -3). \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{BC} &=(5, -10).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](images/5e/5e02968249ec36c4a1f3135bbffd984f2822275c0f2fb51b477a3ac4412b43e3.png)\n\nCompare the remaining displacement with $\\mathbf{a}$, whose grid displacement is $(2, -4)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Horizontal scale} &=\\frac{5}{2}=\\frac{5}{2} \\\\\n\\text{Vertical scale} &=\\frac{-10}{-4}=\\frac{5}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe scale is positive, so the remaining vector has the same direction as $\\mathbf{a}$. Thus $\\overrightarrow{BC}=\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}$. By the triangle law,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c} &=\\overrightarrow{OB}+\\overrightarrow{BC} \\\\\n&=\\mathbf{b}+\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a} \\\\\n&=\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, so their coefficients are unique. Matching the coefficient of $\\mathbf{a}$ gives $\\lambda=\\frac{5}{2}$."] [:db/add "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11" :question/answer-fields "31fbc945-25d9-596f-a866-e48be95dc2c1"] [:db/ensure "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096701 :knowledge-point/questions "0b0bfae0-92ed-5b58-bac6-9ee6206c2d11"] [:db/add "0d035350-2aeb-5ee3-a2e6-1526c0b91813" :answer/id #uuid "0d035350-2aeb-5ee3-a2e6-1526c0b91813"] [:db/add "0d035350-2aeb-5ee3-a2e6-1526c0b91813" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0d035350-2aeb-5ee3-a2e6-1526c0b91813" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "0d035350-2aeb-5ee3-a2e6-1526c0b91813" :answer/validate] [:db/add "39483930-cd75-5c57-8ac4-d7a34fa64e99" :answer/id #uuid "39483930-cd75-5c57-8ac4-d7a34fa64e99"] [:db/add "39483930-cd75-5c57-8ac4-d7a34fa64e99" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "39483930-cd75-5c57-8ac4-d7a34fa64e99" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}"] [:db/ensure "39483930-cd75-5c57-8ac4-d7a34fa64e99" :answer/validate] [:db/add "24c4696b-4606-576b-aed7-e4f27751718c" :answer/id #uuid "24c4696b-4606-576b-aed7-e4f27751718c"] [:db/add "24c4696b-4606-576b-aed7-e4f27751718c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "24c4696b-4606-576b-aed7-e4f27751718c" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "24c4696b-4606-576b-aed7-e4f27751718c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d0595291-cf88-58c3-b9c2-007ce14cd80e" :answer/id #uuid "d0595291-cf88-58c3-b9c2-007ce14cd80e"] [:db/add "d0595291-cf88-58c3-b9c2-007ce14cd80e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d0595291-cf88-58c3-b9c2-007ce14cd80e" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "d0595291-cf88-58c3-b9c2-007ce14cd80e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8c638cdc-57df-5fcc-b1a6-d50960e0c256" :answer/id #uuid "8c638cdc-57df-5fcc-b1a6-d50960e0c256"] [:db/add "8c638cdc-57df-5fcc-b1a6-d50960e0c256" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8c638cdc-57df-5fcc-b1a6-d50960e0c256" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "8c638cdc-57df-5fcc-b1a6-d50960e0c256" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107"] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/choices "0d035350-2aeb-5ee3-a2e6-1526c0b91813"] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/choices "39483930-cd75-5c57-8ac4-d7a34fa64e99"] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/choices "24c4696b-4606-576b-aed7-e4f27751718c"] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/choices "d0595291-cf88-58c3-b9c2-007ce14cd80e"] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/choices "8c638cdc-57df-5fcc-b1a6-d50960e0c256"] [:db/add "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/correct "0d035350-2aeb-5ee3-a2e6-1526c0b91813"] [:db/ensure "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18" :question/id #uuid "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18"] [:db/add "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18" :question/problem "The arrows show $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf a$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf b$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf c$. Grid squares have side length one unit.\n\n![](images/62/62f920be0ea00c893a287d49095f3951c338d308a339fd65c4b5c739faf8d331.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$."] [:db/add "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18" :question/worked-solution "Construct the known component $\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}$ from $O$, and call its endpoint $P$. Count signed horizontal and vertical grid displacements:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OP} &=\\frac{4}{3}\\,(3, 0)=(4, 0). \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{PC} &=(6, 6).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](images/c8/c8f9055a336a6751224473a371de86577ae3b6c63bed897612b487dd64a7c905.png)\n\nCompare the remaining displacement with $\\mathbf{a}$, whose grid displacement is $(2, 2)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Horizontal scale} &=\\frac{6}{2}=3 \\\\\n\\text{Vertical scale} &=\\frac{6}{2}=3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe scale is positive, so the remaining vector has the same direction as $\\mathbf{a}$. Thus $\\overrightarrow{PC}=3\\mathbf{a}$. By the triangle law,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c} &=\\overrightarrow{OP}+\\overrightarrow{PC} \\\\\n&=\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}+3\\mathbf{a} \\\\\n&=3\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{4}{3}\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, so their coefficients are unique. Matching the coefficient of $\\mathbf{a}$ gives $\\lambda=3$."] [:db/add "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18" :question/answer-fields "7d269654-adc1-5fc9-a04c-e7efda0d8107"] [:db/ensure "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096701 :knowledge-point/questions "c5f7f6d8-ab59-58b4-be81-e566ab6dfb18"] [:db/add "1540a1d8-0515-5d4e-a96f-fc320fd5684c" :answer/id #uuid "1540a1d8-0515-5d4e-a96f-fc320fd5684c"] [:db/add "1540a1d8-0515-5d4e-a96f-fc320fd5684c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1540a1d8-0515-5d4e-a96f-fc320fd5684c" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "1540a1d8-0515-5d4e-a96f-fc320fd5684c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c" :answer-field/id #uuid "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c"] [:db/add "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c" :answer-field/choices "1540a1d8-0515-5d4e-a96f-fc320fd5684c"] [:db/add "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c" :answer-field/correct "1540a1d8-0515-5d4e-a96f-fc320fd5684c"] [:db/ensure "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918" :question/id #uuid "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918"] [:db/add "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918" :question/problem "The arrows show $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf a$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf b$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf c$. Grid squares have side length one unit.\n\n![](images/03/037a78174621485781dff6e86085e2cf8389ff9ae4e148c37346cb23db911b64.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=3\\mathbf{a}+\\lambda\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}."] [:db/add "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918" :question/worked-solution "Construct the known component $3\\mathbf{a}$ from $O$, and call its endpoint $P$. Count signed horizontal and vertical grid displacements:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OP} &=3\\,(1, -1)=(3, -3). \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{PC} &=(-1, 0).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](images/9a/9a193e20dd46765efa19a097c486108c52549134abe3c55757196ed9045bbcd7.png)\n\nCompare the remaining displacement with $\\mathbf{b}$, whose grid displacement is $(-2, 0)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Horizontal scale} &=\\frac{-1}{-2}=\\frac{1}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe scale is positive, so the remaining vector has the same direction as $\\mathbf{b}$. Thus $\\overrightarrow{PC}=\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{b}$. By the triangle law,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c} &=\\overrightarrow{OP}+\\overrightarrow{PC} \\\\\n&=3\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{b} \\\\\n&=3\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, so their coefficients are unique. Matching the coefficient of $\\mathbf{b}$ gives $\\lambda=\\frac{1}{2}$."] [:db/add "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918" :question/answer-fields "99271019-5c08-5e41-8b41-c0dbdb1d4b1c"] [:db/ensure "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096701 :knowledge-point/questions "a4ca5188-16aa-55da-a359-95d4c2a72918"] [:db/ensure 17592186096701 :knowledge-point/validate]]
